c\" type=\"button\" style=\"padding:6px 14px;font-size:0.9rem\">Open Student Quiz</button></a>\n41:   </div>\n42:   <p>Create, customize, and publish your quiz directly to Firebase Firestore.</p>\n43:   \n44:   <label>Quiz Title\n45:     <input id=\"qtitle\" placeholder=\"e.g. C Programming: Switch Case Quiz\">\n46:   </label>\n47:   <label>Quiz Description\n48:     <input id=\"qdesc\" placeholder=\"e.g. 20 items • 20 seconds per question • Anti-cheat active\">\n49:   </label>\n50:   \n51:   <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">\n52:     <button id=\"opt-btn\" class=\"sec\" type=\"button\">Options</button>\n53:     <button id=\"save-btn\" type=\"button\">Save to Firebase</button>\n54:     <button id=\"load-def-btn\" class=\"sec\" type=\"button\">Load Default C Quiz</button>\n55:   </div>\n56:   <p id=\"status-msg\" style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-weight:600\"></p>\n57: </div>\n58: \n59: <div id=\"options-panel\" class=\"card hide\">\n60:   <h2>Quiz Options & Anti-Cheat Rules</h2>\n61:   \n62:   <div class=\"opt-toggle\">\n63:     <div>\n64:       <b>Auto Randomize Questions</b>\n65:       <div style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--mu)\">Shuffle question sequence for every student</div>\n66:     </div>\n67:     <button id=\"btn-rand-q\" class=\"sec\" style=\"padding:6px 14px;font-size:0.9rem\">ON</button>\n68:   </div>\n69: \n70:   <div class=\"opt-toggle\">"}
